  "title": "DHT Holdings, Inc. Announces Fleet Upgrades and Charter Management",
  "summary": "HAMILTON, BERMUDA, June 29, 2026 – DHT Holdings, Inc. (NYSE:DHT) (“DHT” or the “Company”) today announced that it has identified and will implement a proactive design upgrade for its two newbuildings delivering from Hyundai this year. The upgrades are intended to ensure optimal trading eligibility and enhance the vessels’ commercial flexibility. The implementation schedule and […]",
